cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClearText-Video, please cite the ECCV 2026 paper."
type: dataset
title: "ClearText-Video: A Large-Scale Text-Centric Video Dataset Bridging Video Restoration and Scene-Text Enhancement"
abstract: >-
  ClearText-Video is a large-scale, scene-text-aware benchmark for studying
  text-centric video understanding under controlled quality variation. It
  contains 4,639 real-world text-rich videos, 550K+ frames, 1.6M human-verified
  annotations, and 220K+ spatial and temporal question-answer pairs in Chinese
  and English.
